## Project
[Project name] — [1-sentence description]. Status: [active/beta/production].

## Stack
**Backend**: FastAPI · SQLAlchemy 2.x (async) · PostgreSQL + pgvector · Redis (RQ jobs) · Alembic migrations  
**Frontend**: React 18 · TypeScript · Vite · Zustand · React Query · Tailwind  
**Infra**: Docker Compose · GitHub Actions CI · Nginx reverse proxy

## Architecture
```
/
├── backend/
│   ├── app/
│   │   ├── api/routes/     ← FastAPI routers (one file per domain)
│   │   ├── models/         ← SQLAlchemy ORM models
│   │   ├── schemas/        ← Pydantic request/response schemas
│   │   ├── services/       ← Business logic layer (no DB calls here)
│   │   ├── workers/        ← RQ job handlers
│   │   └── core/           ← Config, DB session, auth utilities
│   └── migrations/         ← Alembic (never hand-edit)
└── frontend/
    ├── src/
    │   ├── pages/          ← Route-level components
    │   ├── components/     ← Shared UI components
    │   ├── hooks/          ← Custom React hooks (useXxx pattern)
    │   ├── stores/         ← Zustand stores
    │   └── api/            ← API client functions (axios)
    └── public/
```

## Key Patterns
- **API calls**: all in `frontend/src/api/`, never inline in components
- **Auth**: JWT via `Authorization: Bearer` header; `get_current_user` dep injected in protected routes
- **DB sessions**: `async with get_db() as db:` — never use global session
- **Error handling**: FastAPI HTTPException with structured `{"detail": "..."}` responses
- **Migrations**: `alembic revision --autogenerate -m "description"` then review before applying
- **Job queue**: RQ workers in `backend/workers/`; enqueue via `queue.enqueue(job_fn, args)`

## Dev Conventions
- Branch naming: `feat/`, `fix/`, `chore/` prefixes
- Commits: conventional commits (`feat:`, `fix:`, `docs:`)
- New route → add to router file + add Pydantic schema + add service function
- New model → add SQLAlchemy class + run `alembic revision --autogenerate`
- All env vars declared in `.env.example` before use

