## Never Touch
- `backend/migrations/versions/` — only Alembic should write here
- `frontend/dist/` — build output, gitignored
- `.env` / `.env.production` — never commit secrets
- `CLAUDE.md`, `README.md`, `ai-context/` — auto-generated, edit via code not directly
